# EmailJS — used by the contact / presupuesto form
# Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com/
# In the EmailJS dashboard:
#   1. Add an Email Service (e.g. Outlook/Hotmail for richeacaro28@hotmail.com)
#   2. Create a template that receives the form fields below
#   3. Set the template "To Email" to richeacaro28@hotmail.com (company inbox)
#   4. Copy Service ID, Template ID, and Public Key into this file as .env

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key

# Suggested template variable names (must match your EmailJS template):
#   {{nombre}}           — nombre del cliente
#   {{email}}            — email del cliente (Reply-To)
#   {{telefono}}         — teléfono del cliente
#   {{tipo_trabajo}}     — tipo de trabajo
#   {{zona}}             — zona / ubicación
#   {{fecha_aproximada}} — fecha aproximada
#   {{mensaje}}          — detalles / mensaje
